        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "This emphasizes an increase relative to an earlier state or comparison. Supply that comparison rather than using it as an interchangeable word for very.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我以前喜欢这里，认识了这些朋友以后，更加喜欢这里了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǐqián xǐhuan zhèlǐ ， rènshi le zhèxiē péngyou yǐhòu ， gèngjiā xǐhuan zhèlǐ le 。",
                "meaning": "I liked this place before, and after getting to know these friends I like it even more.",
